      "writtenOn": "2025-08-26T17:31:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Even when a separate doc is needed, that is not tied to `EmbedderTest`, prefer to use scoped objects instead of manually closing. e.g. Use `ScopedFPDFDocument` to control the lifetime instead. The doc may need to be placed in a separate scoped. e.g.\n\n```\n{  // main scope\n  ...\n  {  // source_doc scope\n      ScopedFPDFDocument source_doc(FPDF_LoadDocument(...));\n      ...\n      // Auto close\n  }\n}\n```",
